  "description": "VibeMaths is the next big step towards AGI.\nHow can you trust that 3 + 2 = 5 if your CPU told you it? It's now alive, it doesn't know. \nVibeMath solves this issue by allowing you to ask simple mathmatical questions to real thinking* AI!\nSimply create a VibeMathmatician and let AI do the rest.\n\n*LLMs, the type of AI in question, do not think.",
